{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Kassel, August 19.\n\nMy dear Marie,\n\nI experienced a most pleasant surprise this evening. While I was waiting for my soup at the inn, Heinrich Beer and his wife suddenly entered my room. It was a completely unplanned meeting, as Beer was just returning from here and happened to pass by.\n\nHe was kind enough to tell me that he found me in the best of health. For me, it was a reassuring sight to see an acquaintance who knows me and whose opinion of my condition I value. I hope he did not tell you anything about the heat or my travel discomforts, which I anyway consider mere imagination.\n\nI am still well and enjoy the quiet that is offered here. The evenings are pleasant. I hope Karl and Immanuel are in good health and are diligently occupied with their studies, as befits young men who are working on their minds.\n\nKiss the children.\n\nYour G. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221259,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":197,"prompt_tokens":310,"total_tokens":507,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-6gLzfLrVTLV5osnPFUFyt5Ecf46soIHt","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":310,"prompt_ms":426.977,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.3773451612903225,"prompt_per_second":726.0344233998553,"predicted_n":197,"predicted_ms":4612.584,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.533591836734693,"predicted_per_second":42.49245108598564}}